  "headingOutline": [
    "H1: How our services work.",
    "H2: Built on knowledge. Driven by experience.",
    "H2: Agile resourcing, aligned to your objectives.",
    "H2: Explore Aiimi Services.",
    "H2: Accreditations and frameworks.",
    "H2: Meet the Aiimi Experts.",
    "H2: Expert services relied on by the world's best-run companies.",
    "H2: Talk to us about how we can help."
  ],
  "bodyText": "How our services work.\n\nOn-the-ground expertise in AI, data, and digital – delivered exactly where, when, and how it's needed. \n\nTalk to us\nBuilt on knowledge. Driven by experience.\n\nOur consultants are proven experts, ready to roll up their sleeves and get to the root of the problem. ​Fluent in enterprise scale and complexity, they bring deep domain expertise and real-world experience to your toughest challenges.\n\nProjects.\n\n0+\n\nCustomers.\n\n0+\n\nExperts.\n\n0+\n\nAgile resourcing, aligned to your objectives.\n\nGet the right skills on the ground, whether you need a specialist squad for a fixed-term project or ongoing support through managed services.\n\nBlended teams.\n\nOur people become a valued part of your team, driven by your objectives, invested in your success, and working seamlessly within your organisation.\n\nDiverse talent.\n\nAll our consultants are security-cleared and skilled in our methodology, from our apprentices to practice leads, so you get the right person for the job, plus access to a wider pool of expertise.\n\nFlexibility.\n\nEvery business is different, so we offer flexible commercial arrangements, from Time & Materials to Fixed Price models. We’re agile and adaptable, scaling up or down as required.\n\nService Accelerators.\n\nWhere needed, we’re able to accelerate delivery by leveraging our own IP, with pre-built solutions underpinned by Aiimi's Workplace AI platform.\n\nExplore Aiimi Services.\n\nOur Services Practices are structured to align with enterprise transformation through AI, data, and digital. Drawing on deep experience, we've developed our own tools, playbooks, and proven methodologies to ensure consistent, high-quality delivery.\n\nAI Strategy & Roadmap\nData Strategy\nDigital Products\nResponsible AI\nData Engineering\nDigital Strategy\nBuild & Scale AI\nData Science & Analytics\nAccreditations\nand frameworks.\n\nYou’ll find us on major public sector and government frameworks for AI, data, and digital, with the requisite security clearance and credentials.\n\nMeet the Aiimi Experts.\n\nWe’re responsive and able to source the right team rapidly, so you get the A team every time – whether you’re facing an unprecedented event or need to jump on an opportunity. \n\nGet in touch\nPaul Maker\nChief Technology Officer\nAnja Smoljan\nPrincipal Consultant (Strategic Change Management)\nMike Dixon\nHead Architect\nJordan Slater\nPrincipal Consultant (Business Partner)\nJo Finch\nHead of Research & Experience\nRichard Walker\nHead of Strategy & Governance\nJack Lawton\nPrincipal AI Solutions Architect\nJosh Swords\nHead of Data & AI Engineering\n\n“At Anglian Water, we've been working with Aiimi successfully for years. In fact, they are undeniably at the heart of how we've driven data and digital capabilities in recent times.”\n\nMatt Edwards, CDO\n\nExpert services relied on by the world's best-run companies.\n\nFrom national security and critical infrastructure to central government agencies, leading GSIs, and the world's most prestigious luxury brands – our customers are major enterprise organisations who rely on rapid time to value, peer-to-peer relationships, a results-driven culture, and technology that sets the global standard.\n\nView Case Studies\nTalk to us about how we can help.\n\nWe're here to help, whether you want a quick chat or a deeper dive into how we can help. Just fill in the form and we'll be in touch within one working day.\n\nFirst Name*\nLast Name*\nEmail*\nPhone\nMessage\nHow did you first hear about us?\nPlease select\nSearch engine (e.g. Google, Bing)\nSocial media\nAI (ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude, etc)\nEvent or Webinar\nOnline advertisement\nNews or media article\nPodcast\nOfficial Aiimi Partner\nReview site (e.g. Gartner, G2)\nReferred by an Aiimi customer\nWord of mouth\nColleague or employer\nOther\nFrom time to time, we would like to contact you about our products, services, events and other content that we think will be of interest to you. You can unsubscribe from these communications at any time.\nYes please - I’d like to hear more from Aiimi!\nBy submitting this form you consent to us processing and storing the information you provide in accordance with our Privacy Policy\nSUBMIT"
}